    """D-RL-REFCV3-MIN — the minimal pre-registered *RL stage on/off* experiment on the
    FROZEN refcv3 @ 40,284. ⛔ PREPARED, NOT LAUNCHED (2026-09-05, DeployFlyWheel prep
